OL,3,GNEWSASepsis-related deaths of two
OL,4,Achildren prompt review
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS trust is carrying out a review
OL,7,Finto how it recognises and treats
OL,8,Fsepsis following the deaths of two
OL,9,Fyoung patients in cases where this
OL,10,Fextreme reaction to infection was
OL,11,Finvolved.
OL,13,FCounty Durham and Darlington NHS
OL,14,FFoundation Trust (CDDFT) said two
OL,15,Fyoungsters had died in cases involving
OL,16,Fsepsis in the past 12 months and as a
OL,17,Fresult it was seeking to "improve how
OL,18,Fwe recognise and respond to sepsis".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
